      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clinton%2C_Mississippi"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Clinton Visitor Center showcases the Natchez Trace’s history, with displays that trace the ancient Native American path through the area.",
